Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["I.7 Verification tests of the symbols", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f75ec701-0094-49a4-9359-c2b53c6c958a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every test below has a name (S-1, S-2, ...), states in words what it \
checks, computes it, and records PASS or FAIL with the numbers that decide it \
in the list ",
 StyleBox["SL31`Test`$Results",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". The function ",
 StyleBox["SL31Check[name, statement, condition, details]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " does the recording and prints one line: PASS or FAIL, the name, the \
statement and, after two hyphens, the details. The numbers of the details are \
written as text, so that the front end breaks the line only at spaces: an \
integer in full; a number given as ",
 StyleBox["ScientificForm[x, n]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " with n significant digits in the notation ",
 StyleBox["1.5e-14",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", which means ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1.5", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "14"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4139776b-e685-40c6-a8d8-0b197044fae1"],
 "; a number given as ",
 StyleBox["NumberForm[x, {w, d}]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " with d decimals; every other machine number with six significant digits. A \
row of parts (",
 StyleBox["Row",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ") is replaced by its parts, and neighbouring texts are joined. Every other \
expression (a list, a symbol, a formula, a number of higher precision) is \
printed in its typeset form. The parts are printed as one row whose \
continuation lines are not indented (the option ",
 StyleBox["LineIndent -> 0",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "): with the indentation that the front end gives to the lines of nested \
rows, a line of a check was seen to pass the right edge of the printed page."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e73781e3-b411-439b-9641-a6038e7390cb"],

