                "79008070-97d6-4c84-bcc1-6154ab1bffe7"],
               
               ": a quaternion unit labelled by the isospin index; plain text \
",
               StyleBox["ie1",
                FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
               ", ..., ",
               StyleBox["ie7",
                FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
               ": the bi-octonions ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 RowBox[{
                  StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
