                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "a906e636-1f24-421f-a3fc-ff5e8042f31b"],
               " is also a point of the super-loop manifold ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalL]",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
