                "2c8881dc-aa42-4497-b546-2481d34572d0"],
               ", i.e. unit bi-quaternions (",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 RowBox[{
                  SubscriptBox[
                   StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
                   StyleBox["LL",
                    FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
