                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "ee13a851-20aa-4001-a900-3b41c0814e19"],
               "), a subgroup of ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 SubscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalL]",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
                FontFamily->"Times",
