                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "0d43ff87-f096-4c08-8e65-87f5bff5bd0a"],
               " is the matrix of the map ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 RowBox[{
                  StyleBox["y",
                   FontWeight->"Bold",
