                FontFamily->"Times",
                FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
                "2f14dbd0-f817-42e8-b95c-2770f70022c1"],
               " Dirac matrices of ",
               Cell[BoxData[
                FormBox[
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalR]",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
