            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "4780a641-c884-49e3-b571-0a694a57f7bf"],
           " because the fermion number of ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
