           ": the Ginzburg-Landau mass ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SuperscriptBox[
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
