            "74d5df45-ac96-49fc-8515-c5a2b3def3d3"],
           " in the effective potential of the normal vacuum, ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{"1", "/", 
              SubscriptBox[
               StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
