            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "1f78abbf-0614-4831-82ab-dd5ab1d74480"],
           " is the pairing block with ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              OverscriptBox[
               StyleBox["u", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
