          StyleBox["\<\"\"\>",
           StripOnInput->False,
           FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
           FontSize->8],
          ImageSize->95], 
         PaneBox[Cell["\<\
the part of the second order, in the fields of SFBSv and the gauge \
potentials, of the effective Lagrangian of the superfluid boson singlet state \
together with the Yang-Mills and Maxwell terms of the gauge fields\
\>", "Text",
           FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
           FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
           "666a7323-fb22-4ab6-adea-8849a7182fb7"],
          ImageSize->290]},
        {
         PaneBox[
          TemplateBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["w", "LL", "lat"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["w", "LL", "cmp"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["n", "LL", "cpx"]},
           "RowDefault"],
          ImageSize->125], 
         PaneBox[
          StyleBox["\<\"w_lat w_cmp n_complex\"\>",
           StripOnInput->False,
           FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
           FontSize->8],
          ImageSize->95], 
         PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
           
           "a Nambu mode on the lattice written as one complex vector, the 16 \
components of ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox["\[Psi]", 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["p",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "6397e607-7cae-46a2-883b-945890377838"],
           " and ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox["\[Psi]", 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["h",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "28e83c29-5437-4298-acf3-60942385b017"],
           
           " on every site, the sites one after the other, so that the \
lattice equations read ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
              SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "0"], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "ebb929fa-0337-407c-a455-36743439e6e7"],
           " (for the self-consistent evolution the columns of ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["W",
               FontFamily->"Helvetica",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["m",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "27c5b184-03bd-4a30-9985-2ab46049695a"],
           
           " one after the other); one complex component of it; and the \
number of its complex components, ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox["16", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "5f43bbbe-63ca-42d0-a0f7-3f72957b3117"],
           " times the number of sites (times the number of modes)"
          }], "Text",
           FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
           FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
           "b4a17ae8-957b-4f64-89cb-cb06a05518cb"],
          ImageSize->290]},
        {
         PaneBox[
          TemplateBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["r", "LL", "tol"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["a", "LL", "tol"]},
           "RowDefault"],
          ImageSize->125], 
         PaneBox[
          StyleBox["\<\"rtol atol\"\>",
           StripOnInput->False,
           FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
           FontSize->8],
          ImageSize->95], 
         PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
           
           "the relative and the absolute tolerance of a time integration by \
CVODE (the programs of Test 2) or by IDA (the notebook of Test 2 in the \
Wolfram Language, which calls it through the function ",
           StyleBox["NDSolve",
            FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
           
           "), two integrators of the suite SUNDIALS: the estimated local \
error of every internal step is accepted only if its weighted \
root-mean-square norm is at most 1 (the square root of the mean, over the \
real unknowns, of the squares of the estimated errors, each multiplied by the \
weight of its unknown). The programs of Test 2 give CVODE the weight ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{"1", "/", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["tol",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["cmp",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], "+", 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["tol",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
            "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "73a4ac75-c75c-404c-9e04-439534ed87a6"],
           
           " for the real and for the imaginary part of every complex \
component ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["cmp",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "36846ff0-eb28-4414-933e-ebfe58f3cb56"],
           
           " of the state; IDA has for every real unknown the weight 1 \
divided by the sum of ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["tol",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "f5947e78-5a8a-428d-ace3-cd4af37939a2"],
           " times the modulus of this unknown and ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["tol",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "512d5d01-2a36-4d16-92ed-22e6afeef2a4"]
          }], "Text",
           FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
           FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
           "4737ba00-fbc6-4d2d-ac5c-2159a5b5a2ce"],
          ImageSize->290]},
        {
         PaneBox[
          TemplateBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["h", "LL", "CV"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["q", "LL", "CV"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["h", "LL", "IDA"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["N", "LL", "st"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["N", "LL", "ev"]},
           "RowDefault"],
          ImageSize->125], 
         PaneBox[
          StyleBox["\<\"h_CV q_CV h_IDA N_steps N_evals\"\>",
           StripOnInput->False,
           FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
           FontSize->8],
          ImageSize->95], 
         PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
           
           "the size and the order of an internal step of CVODE (both chosen \
by CVODE, the order from 1 to 12 for the Adams-Moulton formulas); the size of \
an internal step of IDA (chosen by IDA, which uses the backward \
differentiation formulas of the orders 1 to 5 and lengthens a step only by \
doubling it); the number of internal steps of an integration and the number \
of evaluations of its right side ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", 
               StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "c3bf2d06-8c06-437a-bc54-b55a61df13f8"],
           
           " (the cost; one step of the classical Runge-Kutta method of \
fourth order needs 4 evaluations)"
          }], "Text",
           FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
           FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
           "6a8997c1-cb63-492f-8012-7b04d5c82d25"],
          ImageSize->290]},
        {
         PaneBox[
          TemplateBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["B", "LL", "err"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", "LL", "rel"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["w", "LL", "ex"]},
           "RowDefault"],
          ImageSize->125], 
         PaneBox[
          StyleBox["\<\"budget max_deviation w_exact\"\>",
           StripOnInput->False,
           FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
           FontSize->8],
          ImageSize->95], 
         PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
           
           "the accumulated local error that the tolerances of an integration \
allow, ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["err",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["st",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["loc",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "47afc140-cba2-445b-adc3-1b96c41a0a23"],
           ", which is ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["st",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              SqrtBox["2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["tol",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["lat",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "+", 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["tol",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                SqrtBox[
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["cpx",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
            "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "c342d699-d471-40be-8c0b-443bb20bc4a5"],
           " with the weights of CVODE for a state of the norm ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], 
             TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "be82ad8b-ed48-4001-b35c-78f947178cbb"],
           
           ", the expected size of the global error of a unitary evolution; \
and the relative deviation of a computed state from the exact solution, ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
               RowBox[{
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["lat",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["ex",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "/", 
              RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
               SubsuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                StyleBox["LL",
                 FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                StyleBox["ex",
                 FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}]}], 
             TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "df51e014-4f71-4368-8fe3-4a536966055c"],
           ", with the exact solution ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["ex",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "6612432d-60f4-487e-8dc9-a6107b788746"],
           " of the same equations"
          }], "Text",
           FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
           FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
           "9b9a86f2-e3b2-4f28-9a4b-be0e342bdfce"],
          ImageSize->290]},
        {
         PaneBox[
          TemplateBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["B", "LL", "loc"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", "LL", "loc"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["E", "LL", "max"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["r", "LL", "der"], "\", \"", 
            SubsuperscriptBox["B", "LL", "out"]},
           "RowDefault"],
          ImageSize->125], 
         PaneBox[
          
          StyleBox["\<\"budget_step local_error E_max deriv_residual \
budget_out\"\>",
           StripOnInput->False,
           FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
           FontSize->8],
          ImageSize->95], 
         PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
           
           "the local error that the tolerances allow in one internal step: \
if the error of every real unknown equals its tolerance (the inverse of its \
weight), the norm of the error is the norm of the vector of the tolerances, \
which by the triangle inequality is at most ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              SqrtBox["2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["tol",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["lat",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "+", 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["tol",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                SqrtBox[
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["cpx",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
            "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "fa6ce335-9253-4f63-9589-82abc2df58fc"],
           " with the weights of CVODE and at most ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["tol",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
               SubsuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
                StyleBox["LL",
                 FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                StyleBox["lat",
                 FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "+", 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["tol",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              SqrtBox[
               RowBox[{"2", 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["cpx",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], 
            "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "8e0ee073-25f3-45ca-bd0e-a73385af208c"],
           " with the weights of IDA, and these two numbers are ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["loc",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "799e987a-a214-4799-8d80-f16b6a7f7b43"],
           
           "; the exact local error of an internal step, the norm of the \
difference between the computed state at the end of the step and the exact \
solution that starts from the computed state at its beginning (a unitary \
evolution changes the norm of no vector, so the deviation after ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["st",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "733b0a0c-1bd7-4ad1-ac7e-a5a5c2c98968"],
           
           " steps is at most the sum of the local errors of the steps, and \
at most ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["err",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "9119e8bf-5ecb-49c1-8da3-d57c176804f4"],
           " if no ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["loc",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "1c4f296b-3659-44f7-bdab-4dda6799fa85"],
           " exceeds ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["loc",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "decb5adf-959a-4374-86ba-25cfe67d7d71"],
           "); the largest modulus of the eigenvalues ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
               StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
              StyleBox["qp",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "35dc871a-d001-42c2-a95e-e0c572f5ad7b"],
           " of ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             SubsuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["LL",
               FontSlant->"Plain"], 
              StyleBox["lat",
               FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "76fa1a0e-2e82-4488-8417-24e4d0878ee1"],
           
           "; the norm of the difference, at the end of an internal step of \
IDA, between the derivative that ",
           StyleBox["NDSolve",
            FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
           " stores and ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", 
               StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalH]",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["lat",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "51be31cf-250b-40ce-a1d2-211a081f55a7"],
           
           " applied to the stored state (it is not zero, because the \
iteration that solves the equations of a step stops at a tolerance); and the \
bound of the deviation from the exact solution of a state of the norm 1 that ",
           StyleBox["NDSolve",
            FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
           
           " returns between the ends of an internal step of IDA, by the \
polynomial of the third degree with the stored values and derivatives at the \
two ends, ",
           Cell[BoxData[
            FormBox[
             RowBox[{
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["out",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"1", "+", 
                FractionBox["1", "4"], 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["IDA",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                SubsuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
                 StyleBox["LL",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                 StyleBox["max",
                  FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["err",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
              FractionBox["1", "4"], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["IDA",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["LL",
                FontSlant->"Plain"], 
               StyleBox["der",
                FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
              SuperscriptBox[
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["IDA",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
                 SubsuperscriptBox[
                  StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
                  StyleBox["LL",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"], 
                  StyleBox["max",
                   FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "4"], "/", "384"}], 
             TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
            FontFamily->"Times",
            FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
            "28e4a227-b10f-4d45-9e6c-9085bbf6e33b"]
          }], "Text",
           FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
           FontSize->9.5,ExpressionUUID->
           "53061409-93a6-4b79-95da-e22699808cc0"],
          ImageSize->290]}
       },
       AutoDelete->False,
       GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Top}}},
       GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{None}}, "Rows" -> {
           GrayLevel[0.85]}},
       GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
       GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}},
       
       GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{1}}, "Rows" -> {{0.6}}}],
      "Grid"]}
   },
   DefaultBaseStyle->"Column",
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Column"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0040254882881393`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[239]=",ExpressionUUID->"4d460aa3-a5a9-40f3-990b-348c7fe7622e"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["I.9 Summary of the tests of Part I", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1036070f-e4ba-4728-be54-f0e0eaf09494"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<name\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<pass\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<PASS\>\"",
             ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<statement\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", "&"}], ",",
        " ", "SL31`Test`$Results"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
        RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "Bold"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<test\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<result\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<statement\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[240]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d174e427-6e2d-4a70-9289-86aa20b370c2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     StyleBox["\<\"test\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      FontWeight->Bold], 
     StyleBox["\<\"result\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      FontWeight->Bold], 
     StyleBox["\<\"statement\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      FontWeight->Bold]},
    {"\<\"S-1\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"every one of the TeX items of the \
registry is converted into a box structure\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-2\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"every symbolized box is read as one \
atomic symbol (head Symbol)\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-0\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"every string inside the symbolized \
boxes is one token for the front end, so that typed symbols reach the kernel \
unchanged\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-14\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"every symbol typed in its printed \
form is read as one atomic symbol, the one created from its registry TeX\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-3\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"different boxes give different \
symbols, and the boxes stay different after the removal of style boxes\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-4\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"every symbol prints as the box it \
was made from\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-5\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the TeX of every symbol is written \
from its printed form, without the internal name\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-6\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the gap equation written with the \
symbols gives the gap of the condensed vacuum 0.2094933033 at G = 22.5, m = \
0.2, cutoff 1; 2 Delta_vac = 0.4189866 and 2 M_q = 0.5792666\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-7\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"sum over j of sigma^LL_j sigma^LL_j \
= 3 times the unit matrix, and sigma_j sigma_j' = delta_jj' + i sum_j'' \
epsilon_jj'j'' sigma_j'' for all nine pairs (components as symbolized \
symbols)\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-8\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the double sum of eta^LL_pp' x^p \
x^p' over p, p' = 0..3 (16 + 4 symbolized components) is (x^0)^2 - (x^1)^2 - \
(x^2)^2 - (x^3)^2\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-9\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"(M^F_LL / M^W_LL)^2 = 4 (g^F_LL / \
g^v_LL)^2 and the gap follows from M^W_LL (algebra with symbolized symbols)\"\
\>"},
    {"\<\"S-10\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the determinant of the time and \
longitudinal equations vanishes exactly at omega_B^2 = M_W^2 + (Z_s/Z_t) \
k_B^2\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-11\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the sum over iota of T^iota_LL \
T^iota_LL (with T = tau/2 for the symbolized components) is 3/4 times the \
unit matrix\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-12\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"no plain-text name is registered \
for two different entries\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-13\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the imaginary unit, the number sets \
and the operators correspond to I, Reals, Complexes, Tr, Det, DiagonalMatrix, \
Re, Im, KroneckerProduct, Transpose\"\>"},
    {"\<\"S-15\"\>", "\<\"PASS\"\>", "\<\"the reader of formulas reads 18 \
formulas of known reading correctly, converts every formula of the meanings \
of the registry without a problem, with one fraction box for every fraction \
command and one root box for every root command, and sets a number that \
directly follows a letter as part of a name (x5), not as a factor\"\>"}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004025488332694*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[240]=",ExpressionUUID->"9cfab938-80b2-4b2a-94c1-25144b3741f7"]
}, Open  ]],

