Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The isospin turns in a constant isospin potential (check AS-2).",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Now only ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}], "1"], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c77b3208-6e93-411d-bcbb-ae5644970e19"],
 " differs from zero, and it is constant: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["v",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}], "1"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "1", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "37db9134-54d2-4970-bb43-ffd6eb183acf"],
 ". This matrix acts on the isospin index and commutes with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Del]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "046c2ef7-5ec7-4937-b448-3afe06c76501"],
 ", so the evolution of the particle part is a product, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Del]"], "-", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["A",
          FontFamily->"Helvetica",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], 
         RowBox[{
          StyleBox["LL",
           FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Del]"], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["A",
        FontFamily->"Helvetica",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fc347772-318c-4a5a-a430-cea27d42d621"],
 ". Because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "1", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7b76bea2-dd2d-449a-9ff8-8808450cec4b"],
 ", the second factor is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["A",
        FontFamily->"Helvetica",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["pr",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["pr",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "1", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "edf1dbb6-f9e2-4631-9c76-25ca55ea2a22"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["pr",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["v",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9677804d-3ec2-4195-877c-437c46b14a6f"],
 ". A particle that starts as a plane wave of positive energy with isospin \
up, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["pw",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9235f3a1-1ab1-4171-a679-e17d1552d519"],
 " times the isospin vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}], ")"}], 
    StyleBox["T", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bf90b52f-41ca-4b76-8d21-45feab31d307"],
 ", therefore has at the time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f5295ece-4598-4fa9-b906-88030db34e7f"],
 " the phase factor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], 
         StyleBox["lat",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "33abded1-9edf-448c-b0b4-3948a54429e6"],
 " and the isospin vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["cos",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox["1", "2"], 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], 
         StyleBox["pr",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], ",", "\[ThinSpace]", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      StyleBox["sin",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox["1", "2"], 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], 
         StyleBox["pr",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}]}], ")"}], 
    StyleBox["T", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5aa9fd6d-f766-4b97-aabc-3ced51712018"],
 ", and its probability of isospin up is"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9f0d9e22-6134-4f20-beac-1376c5ce552c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", "2"], 
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["pr",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}], ",", "      ", 
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["pr",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["v",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}], "1"]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"4c118bca-f72d-4a7c-85b5-6543711e38f1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The isospin turns about the direction of the potential with the angular \
frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["pr",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7461916a-d2e9-4e34-93cc-0306d87e03ee"],
 ". The potential has zero field strength, and the rotation is exactly the \
gauge transformation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["U",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["A",
        FontFamily->"Helvetica",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}]], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c724872-67c9-4420-9190-72899f6bfff7"],
 " that removes it: in the gauge without the potential the isospin of the \
same particle stays up. The isospin direction of a single mode is therefore \
not gauge invariant; only its direction relative to other objects that carry \
isospin is. For the solvers this solution is a sharp test of the isospin \
structure of the potential term. Check AS-2 takes a ring of 16 sites (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[ScriptL]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["x",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.5"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46fbb2de-d4f0-49fc-a8be-f2fbd0c573b1"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e3f66248-0756-408d-9a01-47bd30685e3c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "0"}], "1"], "\[LongEqual]", "1.5"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70e6df75-aaa6-4ba3-9fee-efa776bdeb77"],
 ", so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["pr",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1.05"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e5d7b311-b5d5-45db-bc90-ed2cecd2e1de"],
 ") and the plane wave of the allowed momentum number 2 with isospin up, \
integrates the lattice equations to the 101 output times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], "\[LongEqual]", "0", ",", "0.16", ",", 
    "\[Ellipsis]", ",", "16"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8a59dba8-c9c4-47db-bf35-a269db7e7816"],
 " (the interval between the output times is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[ScriptL]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["t",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.16"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a78a3ef9-5d84-405e-afb0-24690c1f8446"],
 "), and compares the whole state with the exact solution. The original \
program integrates with CVODE (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "12"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d81a850-9941-4c79-8e2d-de580e98ad71"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["tol",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "14"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "330f5e35-0ae2-4c38-958c-7352bb25d8bf"],
 ") and requires a relative deviation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["rel",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9caf3200-b8ef-4c58-8f34-8e1e78604e97"],
 " below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "9"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5fce3506-a573-4b06-b475-7a77dfbe77a1"],
 ". The notebook integrates with IDA and the same tolerances (function ",
 StyleBox["t2evolveIDAChecked",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of chapter II.1.5) and keeps this requirement. It requires in addition \
that the states at the output times are the cubic Hermite polynomials of the \
stored values and derivatives, and that the largest deviation is at most the \
bound that follows from the measured local errors: the sum of the exact local \
errors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ebb7f027-178b-407c-97bb-d273e1a094fa"],
 " of all internal steps bounds the deviation at the end of every step (the \
evolution is unitary), and chapter II.1.5 carries such a bound to the output \
times, with this sum in place of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["err",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a9753053-e593-4228-99b2-fa7b1588f2e3"],
 ". The largest ratio of a local error to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["loc",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "54d9bcab-5ab5-4076-abc6-970b4fe49a6c"],
 " is printed for information; it is not required to stay below 1, because \
IDA tests its own estimate of the error, in a weighted norm that averages \
over all real unknowns, and half of the real unknowns of this state (the hole \
components) are exactly zero at all times. Figure 3(b) shows the probability \
of isospin up."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"913b91f3-6f4b-4be8-b146-0be6466cbaad"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"AS", "-", "2"}], ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{"a", " ", "chain", " ", "of", " ", "16", " ", "sites"}]}], ";", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "constant", " ", "isospin", " ", "potential", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Av", "^", "1"}], "_", "0"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "1.5", " ", "along", " ", "tau_", "1", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", 
      "potential", " ", "matrix"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "as2N", ",", " ", "as2Ell", ",", " ", "as2Mu", ",", " ", "as2Av10"}], 
      "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"16", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "0.2", ",", " ", "1.5"}], 
      "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Lat", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<n\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"as2N", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<ell\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "as2Ell"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<periodic\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"True", ",", " ", "False", ",", " ", "False"}], "}"}]}], ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<wilson\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1.0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<mass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "mass"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<mu\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "as2Mu"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Fields", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2trivialFields", "[", "as2N", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"as2Fields", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<v0\>\"", ",", " ", "site"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "=", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"t2potential", "[", 
        RowBox[{"gv", ",", " ", "gf", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"as2Av10", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}], ",", 
         " ", "0."}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"site", ",", " ", "as2N"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "allowed", " ", "momentum", " ", "number", " ", "2"}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "and", " ", "the", " ", "eigenvector", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
      "largest", " ", "eigenvalue", " ", "eps_lat", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ",
       "4", " ", "x", " ", "4", " ", "matrix", " ", "of", " ", "the", "\n", 
      "   ", "free", " ", "lattice", " ", "operator", " ", "on", " ", "its", " ",
       "plane", " ", 
      RowBox[{"wave", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "the", " ", "Dirac", " ", "spinor", " ", "of", " ", "chi_pw"}]}]}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Q", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2chainMomentum", "[", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "as2N", ",", " ", "as2Ell"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"as2E4", ",", " ", "as2V4"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2eigh", "[", 
      RowBox[{"t2hLatPlane", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"as2Q", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        "as2Ell", ",", " ", "mass", ",", " ", "1.0", ",", " ", 
        "asChainActive"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Eps", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"as2E4", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Chi4", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"as2V4", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", 
       RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2OmegaPr", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"gv", " ", "as2Av10"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "exact", " ", "solution", " ", "at", " ", "the", " ", "time",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"x0", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "on", " ", "every", " ", "site", " ", "the", " ", "eight", " ", 
        "particle", " ", "components", " ", "chi_pw", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", "x", ")"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"cos", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"i", " ", "sin"}]}], ")"}], " ", "times", " ", "the", "\n", 
        "   ", "phase", " ", "factors", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "time", " ",
         "and", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "plane", " ", "wave"}]}]}], ";", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "hole", " ", "components", " ", "are", " ", "zero"}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"as2Exact", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x0_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Table", "[", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"With", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"phaseSite", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"as2Eps", " ", "-", " ", "as2Mu"}], ")"}], " ", 
               "x0"}], "]"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
              RowBox[{"I", " ", "as2Q", " ", "as2Ell", " ", "site"}], 
              "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"as2Chi4", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", "a", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "phaseSite", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"0.5", " ", "as2OmegaPr", " ", "x0"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                  " ", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"as2Chi4", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", "a", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "phaseSite", " ", "I",
                   " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"0.5", " ", "as2OmegaPr", " ", "x0"}], "]"}]}]}], 
                "}"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"0.", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", "8"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
         "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"site", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"as2N", " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "101", " ", "output", " ", "times", " ", "0"}], ",", 
     " ", "0.16", ",", " ", "...", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"16", ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "integration", " ", "by", " ", "IDA", " ", "with", " ", 
       "the", " ", "tolerances", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "original", " ", 
       "program"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Touts", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"0.16", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "100"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"as2Rtol", ",", " ", "as2Atol"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"1.*^-12", ",", " ", "1.*^-14"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2H", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2dense", "[", 
      RowBox[{"as2Lat", ",", " ", "as2Fields"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Run", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"t2evolveIDAChecked", "[", 
      RowBox[{"as2H", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"as2Exact", "[", "0.", "]"}], ",", " ", "as2Touts", ",", " ", 
       "as2Rtol", ",", " ", "as2Atol"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2ExactStates", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{"as2Exact", ",", " ", "as2Touts"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "norms", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "deviations", " ", "of",
       " ", "the", " ", "states", " ", "from", " ", "the", " ", "exact", " ", 
      "states"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "and", " ", "the", " ", "largest", " ", "relative", " ", "deviation"}]}],
     " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Deviations", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "as2Run", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
           RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<states\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
           "as2ExactStates"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "Infinity", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Norm", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
      RowBox[{"as2Exact", "[", "0.", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2Dev", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "as2Run", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"as2Deviations", "/", 
         RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Norm", ",", " ", "as2ExactStates"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       " ", "Infinity"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "probability", " ", "of", " ", "isospin", " ", "up", " ", 
      "of", " ", "a", " ", 
      RowBox[{"state", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "the", " ", "part", " ", "of", " ", "its", " ", "squared", " ", "norm",
         " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", "particle", " ", "components", " ", 
        "1"}]}]}], ",", " ", "3", ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", "7"}], " ", "*)"}],
    "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"as2Pup", "[", "w_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Partition", "[", 
            RowBox[{"w", ",", " ", "16"}], "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "asUpIndex"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
         "]"}], "^", "2"}], "]"}], "/", 
      RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "w", "]"}], "^", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"the", " ", "rows", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x", "^", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"P_up", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "integration"}], ",", " ", 
       
       RowBox[{"P_up", " ", "exact"}]}], "}"}], " ", "of", " ", "Figure", " ",
      "3", 
     RowBox[{"(", "b", ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"as2PrecessionRows", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "as2Run", "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"as2Touts", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"as2Pup", "[", 
            RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<states\>\"", ",", " ", "i"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
           ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
             RowBox[{"0.5", " ", "as2OmegaPr", " ", 
              RowBox[{"as2Touts", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "^", "2"}]}], "}"}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Length", "[", "as2Touts", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"SL31Check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<AS-2\>\"", ",", 
     " ", "\"\<isospin precession in a constant isospin potential (case A): \
in the potential Av_LL^1_0 = 1.5 (along tau_1, no other field) the \
positive-energy lattice plane wave chi_pw (x) (isospin up) evolves as exp(-i \
(eps_lat - mu) x_LL^0) chi_pw (x) (cos(omega_pr x_LL^0/2), i sin(omega_pr \
x_LL^0/2)) with omega_pr = g_v Av_LL^1_0, so that P_up = cos^2(omega_pr \
x_LL^0/2); the integration of the lattice equations by IDA (SUNDIALS, through \
NDSolve with Method -> \\\"IDA\\\", in place of CVODE of the original \
program; rtol = 1e-12, atol = 1e-14; periodic chain of 16 sites, dx = 0.5, \
r_W = 1, m = 0.4, mu = 0.2, momentum 2 pi 2/(16 dx)) agrees with this exact \
solution at the 101 output times x_LL^0 = 0, 0.16, ..., 16: (1) the relative \
deviation of the whole state stays below 1e-9, the tolerance of the original \
check; (2) the states at the output times are the cubic Hermite polynomials \
of the stored values and derivatives (tolerance 1e-12), and the largest \
deviation is at most the bound that follows from the measured exact local \
errors of the internal steps, (1 + h_IDA E_max/4) (sum of local_error) + \
h_IDA deriv_residual/4 + (h_IDA E_max)^4/384 (norm of the state); the numbers \
of steps and of evaluations of IDA and the largest ratio \
local_error/budget_step, with budget_step = rtol (norm of the state) + atol \
sqrt(512), are stated\>\"", ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "as2Run", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"as2Dev", " ", "<", " ", "1*^-9"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<hermite\>\"", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
       "1*^-12"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", "as2Deviations", "]"}], " ", "<=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<bsum\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "as2Run", "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<largest relative deviation \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", "as2Dev", "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\< <= bound/(norm of the state) \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<bsum\>\"", "]"}], "/", "as2Norm"}], 
           "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<; (sum of local_error)/(norm of the state) \>\"", ",", 
          " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<sumloc\>\"", "]"}], "/", "as2Norm"}], 
           "]"}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", "\"\<; largest local_error/budget_step \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", 
           RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<ratio\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", "\"\<; IDA: N_steps \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<steps\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, N_evals \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<evaluations\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, largest h_IDA \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", 
           RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<hmax\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, largest deriv_residual \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", 
           RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<residual\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n",
           "     ", "\"\<, Hermite polynomials within \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asSci", "[", 
           RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<hermite\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, E_max \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asFix", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"as2Run", "[", "\"\<emax\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", "4"}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<; omega_pr = \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asFix", "[", 
           RowBox[{"as2OmegaPr", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, eps_lat = \>\"", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"asFix", "[", 
           RowBox[{"as2Eps", ",", " ", "6"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", "\"\< (original program, CVODE: largest relative deviation \
1.3e-11, 1013 steps, 1494 evaluations of the right side; omega_pr = 1.0500, \
eps_lat = 1.723884)\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
       "   ", "\"\<the integration by IDA failed\>\""}], "]"}]}], 
    "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[655]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a2ff292a-dd90-4bc4-a467-d72c22b25d41"],

Cell[BoxData[
 StyleBox[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["\"PASS  \"", Bold, 
     RGBColor[0, 
      Rational[2, 3], 0], StripOnInput -> False], "\"AS-2: \"", 
    "\"isospin precession in a constant isospin potential (case A): in the \
potential Av_LL^1_0 = 1.5 (along tau_1, no other field) the positive-energy \
lattice plane wave chi_pw (x) (isospin up) evolves as exp(-i (eps_lat - mu) \
x_LL^0) chi_pw (x) (cos(omega_pr x_LL^0/2), i sin(omega_pr x_LL^0/2)) with \
omega_pr = g_v Av_LL^1_0, so that P_up = cos^2(omega_pr x_LL^0/2); the \
integration of the lattice equations by IDA (SUNDIALS, through NDSolve with \
Method -> \\\"IDA\\\", in place of CVODE of the original program; rtol = \
1e-12, atol = 1e-14; periodic chain of 16 sites, dx = 0.5, r_W = 1, m = 0.4, \
mu = 0.2, momentum 2 pi 2/(16 dx)) agrees with this exact solution at the 101 \
output times x_LL^0 = 0, 0.16, ..., 16: (1) the relative deviation of the \
whole state stays below 1e-9, the tolerance of the original check; (2) the \
states at the output times are the cubic Hermite polynomials of the stored \
values and derivatives (tolerance 1e-12), and the largest deviation is at \
most the bound that follows from the measured exact local errors of the \
internal steps, (1 + h_IDA E_max/4) (sum of local_error) + h_IDA \
deriv_residual/4 + (h_IDA E_max)^4/384 (norm of the state); the numbers of \
steps and of evaluations of IDA and the largest ratio \
local_error/budget_step, with budget_step = rtol (norm of the state) + atol \
sqrt(512), are stated\"", 
    "\"  -- largest relative deviation 3.4e-10 <= bound/(norm of the state) \
1.4e-9; (sum of local_error)/(norm of the state) 3.4e-10; largest \
local_error/budget_step 1.1e-1; IDA: N_steps 4045, N_evals 15882, largest \
h_IDA 5.0e-3, largest deriv_residual 4.8e-11, Hermite polynomials within \
5.7e-16, E_max 5.1250; omega_pr = 1.0500, eps_lat = 1.723884 (original \
program, CVODE: largest relative deviation 1.3e-11, 1013 steps, 1494 \
evaluations of the right side; omega_pr = 1.0500, eps_lat = 1.723884)\""},
   "RowDefault"],
  StripOnInput->False,
