Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Case D: Landau levels in constant magnetic fields (check AS-10)\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"8e69c585-31c9-4e0d-9288-2cbeb62a6319"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The fields.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " No pair field, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "39b16eb2-412e-4f51-bf9b-68ca2101f96b"],
 ", and constant magnetic fields along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "aa2dd3ba-2789-4bb0-b261-76461c587092"],
 " of the fermion number and of the third isospin direction: the field \
strengths ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], 
    StyleBox["F",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d6f54e06-b060-4239-be01-0697e9aa2310"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], "3"], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "96038fcc-f311-4ab3-a4f7-7aabab3afe8c"],
 ", in the Landau gauge ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "2"}], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "aee97682-b5f3-4b26-ac73-67dccaef49fc"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "2"}], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], "3"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a36e410c-a100-4c90-8a9a-ed848f10173c"],
 " (all other potentials are zero). On the isospin-up components the \
potential is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "2"}], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "94524688-84b3-46b3-b32c-d0f30cf52734"],
 " and on the isospin-down components ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "2"}], "\[DownArrow]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[DownArrow]"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bd5a8bd3-db13-42b6-aad2-4e1bfe59ecde"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["v",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], "3"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "908470d7-a556-4bca-80bf-f3b3062140eb"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[DownArrow]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["v",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], "3"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "86281310-7760-4eaf-b473-8f410b20509d"],
 ": the two isospin components feel different magnetic fields."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9c5a76e8-c6e1-43b5-9d14-f1010e5c0e59"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The solution.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Square the covariant Dirac Hamiltonian ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Del]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Del]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "71f09973-9a05-4a1b-a6e8-62b7ef3d4212"],
 ". The terms with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c26e02ea-307e-4562-9885-1546c99c2c30"],
 " cancel, the terms with twice the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "899d221f-58d3-4d15-bdcc-860574835311"],
 " give ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
       SubsuperscriptBox["\[Del]", 
        StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2e810385-1810-4b6f-b753-63651bf3aadc"],
 ", and the terms with two different matrices combine into commutators of \
covariant derivatives, which are the field strengths (check GS-6), multiplied \
by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["s",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fe23b1d9-4851-4a6b-8828-dfc3fb328fa4"],
 " for the cyclic triples ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], ",", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], ",", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4f724af0-97dc-45cc-b26a-ad8ef52ac195"],
 " (check GS-2). Here only the field strengths with the indices 12 differ \
from zero. On the isospin-up components, and on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["exp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "+", 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"]}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "05c853b9-a9dc-44ef-a02a-ac48cdde2f81"],
 " times a function of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "be6e2858-341d-49b6-a20e-56695d3fb766"],
 ", the square is"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4f4d1cdf-8b1b-4e22-82ca-5c3be2343cf9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Del]"], ")"}], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "+", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["d", "TI"], "2"], 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"(", 
          SubsuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["LL",
            FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], ")"}], "2"]}]]}], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], ")"}], "2"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], "-", 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "/", 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"]}], ")"}], "2"]}], ")"}], "-", 
   "2", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["s",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",\

 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"bc971c08-6a49-4a81-89cf-b059968ad88a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["s",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "3", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "3", 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0155727d-c48d-4887-abbf-098bc7a8d2df"],
 " is the spin of the spinor charge along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "21880e57-fafe-4110-b515-616556a04e90"],
 ". The large bracket is a harmonic oscillator centred at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dd5700a-25cc-4ee9-8e3d-bb4939ba4e36"],
 ", with the eigenvalues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "411663d0-0aa9-4908-819b-3cf10d905be1"],
 " times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", ",", "3", ",", "5", ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a67bc83b-d994-46b9-9f2f-8b5aa3cb2a6e"],
 "; the spin has the eigenvalues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cae746d4-df4f-495a-8769-69bf6c3eacdc"],
 " and commutes with the bracket. The sum of the oscillator eigenvalue and of \
the spin term ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[MinusPlus]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f5270a1-0ad8-4db1-b7c8-6451e3bf7c1b"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e322098a-6733-4883-bcb1-fb4ffbadac31"],
 " with the number ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0", ",", "1", ",", "2", ",", 
    "\[Ellipsis]"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2a981547-16fe-4026-878b-f97e53638f01"],
 " of the Landau level: the level 0 arises only from the lowest oscillator \
state with the spin parallel to the field, and every level ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[GreaterEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a76f1bef-bd4e-4421-86b7-78982bf7c397"],
 " from two combinations (the oscillator state with the number ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["L",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "80ef5ea4-86e3-4852-9b5e-eb3e293f989a"],
 " and the parallel spin, and the oscillator state with the number ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c66ec778-7da2-4d0e-b9e8-7e7211238c37"],
 " and the antiparallel spin). The energies are therefore"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"afebb3ec-8ed5-4dcb-83f3-ee62c7bcc58c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["qp",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "+", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["LL",
           FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], ")"}], "2"], "+", "2", 
       SubsuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox["L",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
       RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["LL",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}]}], 
      ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]}], ",", "      ", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["L",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0", ",", "1", ",", "2", ",", 
   "\[Ellipsis]"}], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"c26d5d03-a662-46f0-9a77-2a3e5b4fc7b6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd377e6a-ffd9-4892-92f6-b9455dd640a7"],
 " (the position of the centre: the levels are degenerate), and the same with \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[DownArrow]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e45be49-3e9f-470e-bf10-492cddb2c6a1"],
 " for isospin down. At ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "45db9314-53d3-4f24-914c-9e6be3f52105"],
 " the level 0 has the energies ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "af3b39b0-cc28-4e08-96bd-59a9914df284"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "accca66c-b3a7-4958-9560-2ddfe203a579"],
 " once each, and every level ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[GreaterEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "569708c6-7d59-4ba7-b868-760f09b588e1"],
 " has each of its two energies twice. The level 0 does not depend on the \
field: the energy of the spin cancels the zero-point energy of the oscillator \
exactly, because the magnetic moment of a Dirac particle has the gyromagnetic \
factor 2, for the charge of the fermion number and for the isospin charge \
alike. Check AS-10 diagonalizes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Del]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "39265381-a62a-4a41-bace-879c35ccbd8f"],
 " at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8a2fe75d-7774-4e67-8b92-6dd6f63a0e1b"],
 ", which for one isospin component is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c7925ac-3b3f-4b8a-bb48-bad3dd1f9df3"],
 " matrix operator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], "/", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"]}], ")"}], "-", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b7d601d5-dfbe-47e1-a680-f75b5aafdc6e"],
 " (and the same with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[DownArrow]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "719b1799-9c01-40ea-8b56-983eaf03aae4"],
 "), in a basis of 120 oscillator states of the frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "795c6b7a-b742-4d2a-b7c8-628290c6fcea"],
 " (or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[DownArrow]"], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bc80c76a-b2d5-4136-8aba-467d66002284"],
 "). The fields are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1.2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "92fcb4cc-1564-46d8-b698-e15c4d9e2f1c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["F",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], ",", "12"}], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", "1.0"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "da4b078b-60a6-4690-8a92-57869cbd62da"],
 ", so that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], "\[LongEqual]", "0.89"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66e54154-2aff-4ebd-bea6-a242022229cb"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[DownArrow]"], "\[LongEqual]", "0.19"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "85e0385b-db58-4eca-a24f-d32e092ef952"],
 ". In the oscillator basis the position and the momentum are matrices whose \
only entries stand next to the diagonal (the comments of the code state \
them). The exact eigenstates of the level ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["L",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1efaf8f3-4798-4b2a-894b-1d853a3d2d5a"],
 " contain only the oscillator states with the numbers ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "872cb3bc-0375-4397-bf5f-0079a91a05a3"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["L",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0795f19b-c560-46dc-84fd-8a13f08fb21e"],
 ", so the basis, whose states have the numbers 0 to 119, represents the \
levels 0 to 119 exactly (the level 0 contains only the oscillator state 0). \
It has no state with the number 120: the oscillator state 119 with the \
antiparallel spin has lost its partner, and the truncated matrix has, instead \
of the level 120, two states with the energies ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "71bf54e1-acfa-434b-8c10-87b224312b4e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c7cd0a15-165f-4fc4-91a9-180c43ca8c0f"],
 " that live on the oscillator state 119. These two states are artefacts of \
the truncation. The check discards every eigenvector with a weight above ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "8"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "18250e68-89be-4b2e-a72b-ccea235c283f"],
 " on the ten highest oscillator states (the numbers 110 to 119): for each \
isospin component these are the two artefacts and the forty states of the \
levels 110 to 119, which the check does not need. It then compares the \
remaining energies with the formula for the levels 0 to 10, with their \
multiplicities, and requires that no other energy lies below the level 10. \
Figure 6 shows the levels."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ede896fb-5a52-4d06-a539-19b53489138f"],

