Cell[TextData[{
 "Check T2-DATA-2 compares every list, row by row and column by column, with \
the rows that this chapter computed (",
 StyleBox["as1CurveRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as1LatticeRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as2PrecessionRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as3CurveRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as3LatticeRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as5GapRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as4RabiRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as9ConvergenceRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as9ProfileRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as9SpectrumRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["as10LandauRows",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "). A column that the file prints with 10 decimals may deviate by half a \
unit of the last printed decimal, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"5", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "11"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b2d320e0-353d-414b-811d-772d46e4fea9"],
 " (the check allows ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"5.1", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "11"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4aa602c8-4a6f-4859-a868-26d0ef8d9cfc"],
 "); the times may deviate by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"5.1", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "5"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "840f7c62-1509-49ee-9fff-df18099380a4"],
 ", the ratio of the couplings by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"5.1", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "6"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "84e52149-b923-4512-a0af-5f74042f4aec"],
 ", and the relative residual by the fraction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"5.1", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "7"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "df4e581e-c5af-4c7b-8e4a-d03658fbe632"],
 " of itself. The charges, the branches, the numbers of the levels and of the \
eigenvalues, and the sources must be equal. A larger deviation would mean \
that the rewritten program computes different numbers. Two columns hold \
results of the integration by CVODE, which the notebook replaces by IDA: the \
probabilities ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[UpArrow]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "de59788d-9018-4fb9-a2e3-cc3716bd2e61"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["h",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "de386b6c-0414-4063-9c52-2fbfc1d7e968"],
 " of the integrated states. They need not agree to the last decimal, but \
within the accuracy of the two integrations. If a computed state has the \
relative deviation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["rel",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f7e3f466-edcf-47e6-a4f8-0680e51a57b6"],
 " from the exact state, the two states, each divided by its norm, differ by \
at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["rel",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "410d6de7-09fa-4adc-9f78-f817783272db"],
 " (the norms of the two states differ by at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["rel",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "babd9f60-baea-45d0-bd89-3d735bb804f6"],
 " times the norm of the exact state, and so do the states). A probability is \
the square of the norm of the part of the normalized state in the isospin-up \
(or the hole) components; these norms are at most 1 and differ by at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["rel",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07493769-a679-4f00-bea6-5553eeed15d7"],
 ", so the probabilities differ by at most ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["rel",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "72d68f8e-34b8-40a2-88a2-b8189809f09e"],
 ". The probability of IDA and that of CVODE therefore differ by at most 4 \
times the sum of their two largest relative deviations, plus the rounding of \
the file. The largest relative deviation of IDA is the one measured in check \
AS-2 or AS-4; that of CVODE is taken from the original report, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1.3", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "11"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "08ad5ee3-e9a8-4c0a-91fe-c0c7e7e44661"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4.7", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bbe19ab4-ce65-4646-ab26-ac9ff679fb90"],
 ", which are printed with two digits, so that the bounds ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1.35", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "11"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3c85764e-4ce5-472a-b555-d09b56ea6db1"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4.75", "\[Times]", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "42e46534-bb64-4eb9-936a-5582a1f14ce7"],
 " are used."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1e2e34b1-988f-4907-bb1a-1d4dd0c4aabf"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "two", " ", "lists", " ", "of", " ", "rows", " ", "have", " ", "the", " ", 
    "same", " ", "dimensions", " ", "and", " ", "equal", " ", "columns", " ", 
    "cols", " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"charges", ",", " ", "branches", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"numbers", " ", "of", " ", "levels"}], ",", " ", "sources"}], 
     ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"t2rowsEqual", "[", 
      RowBox[{"rowsHere_", ",", " ", "rowsOriginal_", ",", " ", "cols_"}], 
      "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "rowsHere", "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "rowsOriginal", "]"}]}], " ", "&&", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"rowsHere", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "cols"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"rowsOriginal", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "cols"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
        " ", "==", " ", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{"the", " ", "columns", " ", "printed", " ", "with", " ", "10", " ", 
     RowBox[{"decimals", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "largest", " ", "deviation", " ", "in", " ", "every", " ", 
       "file"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"asDataDev10", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"t2rowsDeviation", "[", 
        RowBox[{"as1CurveRows", ",", " ", "t2origACurves", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"t2rowsDeviation", "[", 
        RowBox[{"as1LatticeRows", ",", " ", "t2origALattice", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"t2rowsDeviation", "[", 
        RowBox[{
        "as2PrecessionRows", ",", " ", "t2origAPrecession", ",", " ", 
